            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's New in 0.1.0</h2>
<h3>Features</h3>
<ul>
<li>Initial menu-bar app for tracking GitHub repository stars and latest release downloads.</li>
<li>Optional GitHub OAuth device flow for browsing public repositories available to the signed-in user.</li>
<li>Sparkle update support with automatic checks and automatic downloads enabled by default.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Improvements</h3>
<ul>
<li>Local-only storage for tracked repository metadata and settings.</li>
</ul>
<p>Full release notes: <a href="https://github.com/jazzyalex/GH-menu-stars/releases/tag/v0.1.0">https://github.com/jazzyalex/GH-menu-stars/releases/tag/v0.1.0</a></p>
]]></description>
